1
00:00:00,511 --> 00:00:03,681
(Sheldon:)Why don't you text him that
and see if he backs down?

2
00:00:04,348 --> 00:00:06,018
(Raj:)No.

3
00:00:07,018 --> 00:00:10,108
(Leonard:)I'm going to assert
my dominance face to face.

4
00:00:10,271 --> 00:00:11,351
(Sheldon:)Face to face?

5
00:00:11,522 --> 00:00:15,192
Are you gonna wait for him to sit down
or you gonna stand on the coffee table?

6
00:00:16,694 --> 00:00:18,444
(Leonard:)Hello, Penny. Hello, Kurt.

7
00:00:18,613 --> 00:00:20,403
(Penny(arriving):)Oh, hey, guys.
You having a good time?

8
00:00:20,573 --> 00:00:22,203
(Sheldon:)Given the reaction to my costume...

9
00:00:22,366 --> 00:00:26,206
(Sheldon:)...this party is a scathing indictment
of the American education system.

10
00:00:26,704 --> 00:00:28,284
What? You're a zebra, right?

11
00:00:29,373 --> 00:00:31,873
(Sheldon:)Yet another child left behind.

12
00:00:32,543 --> 00:00:34,713
(Kurt:)And what are you supposed to be,
an elf?

13
00:00:34,879 --> 00:00:36,089
(Leonard:)No, I'm a hobbit.

14
00:00:36,255 --> 00:00:37,545
(Kurt:)What's the difference?

15
00:00:37,715 --> 00:00:40,715
(Leonard:)A hobbit is a mortal, halfling inhabitant
of Middle-earth...

16
00:00:40,885 --> 00:00:44,015
(Leonard:)...whereas an elf
is an immortal, tall warrior.

17
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:47,060
(Kurt:)So why the hell
would you wanna be a hobbit?

18
00:00:47,433 --> 00:00:51,523
Because he's neither tall nor immortal,
and none of us could be the Flash.

19
00:00:52,688 --> 00:00:56,778
(Kurt:)Well, whatever. Why don't you go hop off
on a quest? I'm talking to Penny here.

20
00:00:56,943 --> 00:00:58,903
(Leonard:)I think we're all talking to Penny here.

21
00:00:59,070 --> 00:01:01,020
I'm not. No offense.

